cleanup failure prevents success/retries. Test failure clears success target metadata. Generic Backend/run trusted implementation, no arbitrary-program security claims. Probe explicit flag parser, snapshots initial GPU ticketed reports, final health must require nonempty successful current GPU device/gen/epoch matches; no hotplug auto-retest. Root Driver gates model.is_ready and owns seat/broker during local testing. No page-flip/front/pending/client buffer lifetimes claimed. Author tests cover coordinator fake-target lifetimes/fallback/failure/cleanup, flags and parser/health only; actual GBM/EGL/ioctls/provider errors unrun. Planned negative mutations removing vector retention, ignoring cleanup and TEST_ONLY bit should fail; author execution not independently verified by you. Look for reachable HIGH/MEDIUM issues in resource order on partial errors, flags/properties/KMS semantics, render sync, framebuffer/mode blob cleanup, unbounded application allocations, buffer layout/formats/fallback, error paths or misleading test/oracle claims. Separate missing later native rendering/rollback/hardware work explicitly documented. Cite source/path/trigger, checked controls and actual test limits. No certification.' 
